  "question": {
    "text": "The maximum area (in sq. units) bounded by <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> and the line <math><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is"
  },
