  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0029_c0818a50e72f.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.36042in;height:1.67986in\" /><br />The area bounded is maximum if slope of the line <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is greatest, i.e. <math><mn>4</mn></math> .<br />Hence, the required area&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msubsup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> sq. units"
  }
